{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf28Ng52jFkatMZAT5QSz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I built the todo app as `index.html` in the repo root. I tested it in headless Chromium, opened straight from the filesystem, and it passed.\n\n**What the test showed:**\n- Adding three todos showed three rows. Text that is only spaces was not added.\n- Deleting the middle todo and reloading the page left the other two in place.\n- `localStorage[\"todos\"]` holds a list of `{ id, text, createdAt }`.\n- There were no page errors and no network requests.\n- Text containing HTML tags shows as plain text, so it can't inject anything into the page.\n\n**How it works:**\n- All six `data-testid` attributes are used exactly as given.\n- The input and Add button sit in a form, so pressing Enter also adds a todo.\n- Each `id` comes from `crypto.randomUUID()`, with a fallback where that isn't available. `createdAt` is a timestamp in milliseconds.\n- If the saved data is broken or storage is blocked, the app starts with an empty list instead of crashing.\n\nI haven't committed anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":553,"cache_read_input_tokens":40855,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":553},"output_tokens":337,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"93b25bf0-3e23-4201-bfad-9648b961b096","uuid":"10238ea2-5494-4224-92d2-d15bc4d895b7","timestamp":"2026-09-13T21:12:47.390Z","request_id":"req_011Cf28NfEfLLoY2b7BqLTLo"}
